    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Revenants</strong> is a turn-based strategy game with RPG elements inspired by ATOM RPG and XCOM.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re one of the survivors of the nuclear war. Try to survive in a post-apocalyptic world. Find companions, upgrade your skills and fight for staying alive. Your life depends on your decisions and tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/25a8f4c3510a849c536f38381f14fde1.avif?t=1754805330\" width=363 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find different weapons in the world, from a machine gun to a water pipe. Choose what you like. Aim and shoot at enemies with a gun or stab them with a handmade spear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/3c9c75109502377f6a995ec68c378b96.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/3c9c75109502377f6a995ec68c378b96.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/e13cac879dcd481481bfa16682bfa8e7.webp?t=1754805330\" width=330 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search residential buildings, shops, pharmacies and cars in automatic or manual mode. Collect weapons, equipment, supplies \u2014 anything that can help you live longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/7b65fb1d21f15ba6be1db4b8555b83a9.webp?t=1754805330\" width=245 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't take everything you find with you, so take only what you need. Place things in your inventory. You can also craft different items. Try to combine collected materials and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/b8bff14805b4f30de1d6fbe856d56a28.webp?t=1754805330\" width=208 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your hunger, thirst, and energy levels. Illnesses, injuries, and radiation will affect the characters' health. Use medicine to get rid of the negative effects. Along the way, you will also get into unexpected situations, and even the life of your comrade may depend on your actions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d9585697c54063f027345f6b4ffeb29e.webp?t=1754805330\" width=617 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Revenants</strong> is a turn-based strategy game with RPG elements inspired by ATOM RPG and XCOM.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re one of the survivors of the nuclear war. Try to survive in a post-apocalyptic world. Find companions, upgrade your skills and fight for staying alive. Your life depends on your decisions and tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/25a8f4c3510a849c536f38381f14fde1.avif?t=1754805330\" width=363 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find different weapons in the world, from a machine gun to a water pipe. Choose what you like. Aim and shoot at enemies with a gun or stab them with a handmade spear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/3c9c75109502377f6a995ec68c378b96.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/3c9c75109502377f6a995ec68c378b96.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/e13cac879dcd481481bfa16682bfa8e7.webp?t=1754805330\" width=330 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search residential buildings, shops, pharmacies and cars in automatic or manual mode. Collect weapons, equipment, supplies \u2014 anything that can help you live longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5f2ca33dc783f90b13b8005cfaf49eae.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/7b65fb1d21f15ba6be1db4b8555b83a9.webp?t=1754805330\" width=245 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't take everything you find with you, so take only what you need. Place things in your inventory. You can also craft different items. Try to combine collected materials and see what happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/5b54fc3153c38ce378cc3f5811969ab1.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/b8bff14805b4f30de1d6fbe856d56a28.webp?t=1754805330\" width=208 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your hunger, thirst, and energy levels. Illnesses, injuries, and radiation will affect the characters' health. Use medicine to get rid of the negative effects. Along the way, you will also get into unexpected situations, and even the life of your comrade may depend on your actions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/0cf5ee5a943238fe57066fe504cb1f8c.mp4?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/d9585697c54063f027345f6b4ffeb29e.webp?t=1754805330\" width=617 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.poster.avif?t=1754805330\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286430/extras/75a01d3bba468006b82af4830f9c3b0c.webm?t=1754805330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Revenants is a turn-based strategy game inspired by ATOM RPG and XCOM. In the post-apocalypse world, there\u2019s only you, a bunch of survivors and hordes of monsters. Anything can end your life here, whether it's a disease or just a pack of rats. How long can you stay alive?",
